2. When White undercuts a lower framework, replace the whole territorial count. E2/F2/G2 removed the earlier lower room; G4/G5 and early G7/E7/C7 retained another viable base.
3. Include ALL connected enemy stones in liberty reading. G6 joined F6; the pre-move one-liberty claim was wrong and corrected before H6.
4. H6/H5/H7 were separate blocking/connection turns. C8/B8 also supplied real joins. Legal diagonal relationships alone do not establish connection.
5. Three physically separate lower groups shared true A1/A3/B2 without captures. Inspect each boundary group's other space instead of filling eyes unnecessarily.
6. E9 remained isolated after capturing E8; shared D9/E8 plus other room proved life. B9 containment/capture restored the upper outline.
7. Final lower11+upper/right36=47 had three-point shift margin to a draw. Internal life turns and captures inside that outline added no extra area.
